{"data":{"body":"[P1] Add a finite request timeout. This request and `insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/OpenSearchExporter.java:136` can wait indefinitely after a peer accepts the connection. Because `onInvocationEnd()` drains exporter workers, a stalled endpoint can force the durable invocation to hit its Lambda timeout repeatedly. Add validated timeout options and set `HttpRequest.timeout()` for both exporters.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7uDr0D","finding_digest":"67ad3a262996d23846e945e04f7825c1c6d34ef717e33f2fbb5580687dbed696","finding_id":"arf_v1_m6wtujrjs3jdqrxjixqe66bfyh","finding_key":"insight-plugin/http-exporters::send::bounded-invocation-lifetime","identity_key":"insight-plugin/http-exporters::send::bounded-invocation-lifetime","line":98,"observation_digest":"29528c42e74140768701e66a5c3bfdf8c988fe1fb2d0a9b0b5629eb45a9894ec","observation_id":"aro_v1_ffjiyqxhifahnbyb4zvfyo757d","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/OTelExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:38:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fvb4mdyhvhqy66uufdxoiwogo4","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"360348e553f6a45c0fedda24ade3e79cf34b0f72","reviewer":"codex","start_line":96,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_fwhxbuxnzkc5nfafpbc7a3nhnk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:38:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
